ce on A and C. Also we could ask for any info on D's temperament impact. But we already asked and got none. Could ask other panel members for any further info on D's crew cooperation. But we can still argue.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's point about lack of evidence for A, and that B's strengths are confirmed. We can say that while B's reliability and stress handling are solid, the weak memory for numbers is a critical gap, whereas D's strengths in concentration and problem solving directly mitigate attention issues, and his responsibility is strong. Therefore I still favor D.\n\nThus vote D.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: D concentrates very well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously; D has hot temper, know-it-all. B has weak memory for numbers, makes nasty remarks. Use these to argue.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
